+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- Subcommands and nested groups read their defaults from their own entry in
+  the parent's `default_map`, instead of receiving the parent's whole map.
+  Previously, `default_map={"sub": {"opt": 1}}` ignored `opt` for `sub`.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
